    <item>
      <title>2022年度总结</title>
      <link>https://invert-viewer.github.io/2022-annual-summary/</link>
      <guid>https://invert-viewer.github.io/2022-annual-summary/</guid>
      <pubDate>Sat, 31 Dec 2022 15:48:34 GMT</pubDate>
      
        
        
      <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;s&gt;什么？你告诉我马上都 2023 了？我 2022 还没过够呢！&lt;/s&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;就让我们再次祝贺地球再一次围绕着太阳公转了一圈！&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;六月的2022高考&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;anchor&quot; href=&quot;#六月的2022高考</description>
        
      
      
      
      <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><s>什么？你告诉我马上都 2023 了？我 2022 还没过够呢！</s></p><p><em>就让我们再次祝贺地球再一次围绕着太阳公转了一圈！</em></p><h2 id="六月的2022高考"><a class="anchor" href="#六月的2022高考">#</a> 六月的 2022 高考</h2><p>刚拿到试卷那一会造成的影响在<a href="https://invert-viewer.github.io/senior-year-departure">这个文章</a>里面写过了，放了将近 6 个月到现在，也有不少新的感想。</p><p>首先造成的就是平常发的数学模拟卷难度陡然递增，本来去年的试卷一大特点就是大计算量和大思维量。可是很遗憾，我对付这些东西仍然是手无寸铁。</p><p>我试图在学校里面找找解决方案，<strong>我找到的却只有无尽的懊恼。</strong></p><p>其次便是我对数学的自信心大幅度下降 (<em>奇妙的是我后来发现这在我们班是普遍现象</em>)，同样是 45 分钟的自主研修，我更倾向于写化学或物理而不是数学。本来有迹可循的 18 题解三角形，本来是必对的题目，可现在做模拟卷却发现形式千变万化，好像没什么规律可循。</p><p>再次是我对我们学校的教研组的彻底失望，形式主义泛滥也就算了，忍忍能过去。可是这么影响深远的高考结束了，高考试卷分析总得有吧？等了半天好像只有语文的，英语就只是简单做一下原卷了事（也有可能是试卷简单的缘故），数学科目只有 <em>第 7 题比大小</em> 和 <em>第 12 题抽象函数的导数</em> 拿出来着重讲过，其他题目闻所未闻！</p><h2 id="十一月-十二月的疫情反复"><a class="anchor" href="#十一月-十二月的疫情反复">#</a> 十一月、十二月的疫情反复</h2><blockquote><p>讲个笑话：</p><p><em>因为开学，本次疫情取消。</em></p></blockquote><div class="note info"><p>你知道吗？</p><p>2020 年初三中考因为疫情放假的，和如今 2023 年高三因为疫情放假的是同一批人哦！(ノへ￣、)</p><p>初三下学期放了三个月寒假，高三上学期又是将近一个月的假期。</p></div><p>可是疫情真的结束了吗？</p><p>是结束，更是开始。</p>]]></content:encoded>
      
      
      
      <category domain="https://invert-viewer.github.io/tags/%E6%9D%82%E8%B0%88/">杂谈</category>
      
      
      <comments>https://invert-viewer.github.io/2022-annual-summary/#disqus_thread</comments>
      
    </item>
    
    <item>
      <title>我的高三碎碎念</title>
      <link>https://invert-viewer.github.io/senior-year-departure/</link>
      <guid>https://invert-viewer.github.io/senior-year-departure/</guid>
      <pubDate>Thu, 30 Jun 2022 13:36:57 GMT</pubDate>
      
        
        
      <description>&lt;div class=&quot;note info&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;“从今年的数学卷子来看，我们还有很长一段路要走。”&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;— 高二下学期班主任&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;note info&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;由于高三学校实在是没什么假期，这篇文章会更新的十分缓慢！&lt;s&gt;</description>
        
      
      
      
      <content:encoded><![CDATA[<div class="note info"><p>“从今年的数学卷子来看，我们还有很长一段路要走。”</p><p>— 高二下学期班主任</p></div><div class="note info"><p>由于高三学校实在是没什么假期，这篇文章会更新的十分缓慢！<s>其实</s><s>说白了就是我懒</s></p><p><s class="danger">这玩意其实就是个流水账……</s></p></div><h2 id="六月"><a class="anchor" href="#六月">#</a> 六月</h2><h3 id="2022年高考"><a class="anchor" href="#2022年高考">#</a> 2022 年高考</h3><p>今年的高考卷…… ヾ (≧へ≦)〃</p><h4 id="新高考i卷"><a class="anchor" href="#新高考i卷">#</a> 新高考 Ⅰ 卷</h4><p>刚拿到试卷电子稿时，印象最深的就是那道立体几何 (19 题，12 分) 的第一问</p><h4 id="全国乙卷"><a class="anchor" href="#全国乙卷">#</a> 全国乙卷</h4><p>最让我感到神奇的是卷子上面 19 题给的相关系数公式是没办法直接带的！要用求和符号的性质来化简（把另一个很难记的公式背下来也行）。</p><p><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mo fence="true">[</mo><mrow><mo fence="true">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="true">‾</mo></mover><mo fence="true">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo fence="true">(</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy="true">‾</mo></mover><mo fence="true">)</mo></mrow><mo fence="true">]</mo></mrow></mrow><msqrt><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><msup><mrow><mo fence="true">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="true">‾</mo></mover><mo fence="true">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>∗</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mtext> </mtext><mo>−</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy="true">‾</mo></mover><msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r=\frac{\sum\left[\left(x_i-\overline{x}\right)\left(y_i-\overline{y}\right)\right]}{\sqrt{\mathrm{\Sigma}\left(x_i-\overline{x}\right)^2\ast\ \mathrm{\Sigma}(y_i\ -\overline{y})^2}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.43056em;vertical-align:0em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right:0.02778em;">r</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2777777777777778em;"></span><span class="mrel">=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2777777777777778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:1.839607em;vertical-align:-0.8296em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mopen nulldelimiter"></span><span class="mfrac"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:1.0100069999999999em;"><span style="top:-2.4265524999999997em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:3em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord sqrt mtight"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:1.090639285714286em;"><span class="svg-align" style="top:-3.428571428571429em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:3.428571428571429em;"></span><span class="mord mtight" style="padding-left:1.19em;"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathrm mtight">Σ</span></span><span class="minner mtight"><span class="minner mtight"><span class="mopen mtight delimcenter" style="top:0em;"><span class="mtight">(</span></span><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">x</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.3280857142857143em;"><span style="top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.07142857142857144em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.5em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">i</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.143em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mbin mtight">−</span><span class="mord overline mtight"><span class="vlist-t"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.6755600000000002em;"><span style="top:-3em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:3em;"></span><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">x</span></span></span><span style="top:-3.57756em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:3em;"></span><span class="overline-line mtight" style="border-bottom-width:0.049em;"></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mclose mtight delimcenter" style="top:0em;"><span class="mtight">)</span></span></span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.8574571428571429em;"><span style="top:-2.8971428571428572em;margin-right:0.07142857142857144em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.5em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight"><span class="mord mtight">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mbin mtight">∗</span><span class="mspace mtight"><span class="mtight"> </span></span><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathrm mtight">Σ</span></span><span class="mopen mtight">(</span><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right:0.03588em;">y</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.3280857142857143em;"><span style="top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.03588em;margin-right:0.07142857142857144em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.5em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">i</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.143em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace mtight"><span class="mtight"> </span></span><span class="mbin mtight">−</span><span class="mord overline mtight"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.6755600000000002em;"><span style="top:-3em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:3em;"></span><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right:0.03588em;">y</span></span></span><span style="top:-3.57756em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:3em;"></span><span class="overline-line mtight" style="border-bottom-width:0.049em;"></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.19444em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mclose mtight"><span class="mclose mtight">)</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.7463142857142857em;"><span style="top:-2.786em;margin-right:0.07142857142857144em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.5em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight"><span class="mord mtight">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style="top:-3.062639285714286em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:3.428571428571429em;"></span><span class="hide-tail mtight" style="min-width:0.853em;height:1.5428571428571431em;"><svg width='400em' height='1.5428571428571431em' viewBox='0 0 400000 1080' preserveAspectRatio='xMinYMin slice'><path d='M95,702c-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14c0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54c44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10s173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429c69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221l0 -0c5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14H400000v40H845.2724s-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7c-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47zM834 80h400000v40h-400000z'/></svg></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.3659321428571427em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style="top:-3.23em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:3em;"></span><span class="frac-line" style="border-bottom-width:0.04em;"></span></span><span style="top:-3.485007em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:3em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mop op-symbol small-op mtight" style="position:relative;top:-0.0000050000000000050004em;">∑</span><span class="minner mtight"><span class="mopen mtight delimcenter" style="top:0em;"><span class="mtight">[</span></span><span class="minner mtight"><span class="mopen mtight delimcenter" style="top:0em;"><span class="mtight">(</span></span><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">x</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.3280857142857143em;"><span style="top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.07142857142857144em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.5em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">i</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.143em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mbin mtight">−</span><span class="mord overline mtight"><span class="vlist-t"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.6755600000000002em;"><span style="top:-3em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:3em;"></span><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">x</span></span></span><span style="top:-3.57756em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:3em;"></span><span class="overline-line mtight" style="border-bottom-width:0.049em;"></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mclose mtight delimcenter" style="top:0em;"><span class="mtight">)</span></span></span><span class="minner mtight"><span class="mopen mtight delimcenter" style="top:0em;"><span class="mtight">(</span></span><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right:0.03588em;">y</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.3280857142857143em;"><span style="top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.03588em;margin-right:0.07142857142857144em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.5em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">i</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.143em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mbin mtight">−</span><span class="mord overline mtight"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.6755600000000002em;"><span style="top:-3em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:3em;"></span><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right:0.03588em;">y</span></span></span><span style="top:-3.57756em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:3em;"></span><span class="overline-line mtight" style="border-bottom-width:0.049em;"></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.19444em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mclose mtight delimcenter" style="top:0em;"><span class="mtight">)</span></span></span><span class="mclose mtight delimcenter" style="top:0em;"><span class="mtight">]</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.8296em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mclose nulldelimiter"></span></span></span></span></span></p><p>可问题是上课时老师只是带我们简单看了一下推导过程，我们都没在意。结果想不到高考居然真的这么弄了！不过好在之后我去仔细看了一下求和符号，至少现在不会太担心了。😏</p><h3 id="誓师大会距离2023高考还有363天"><a class="anchor" href="#誓师大会距离2023高考还有363天">#</a> 誓师大会 — 距离 2023 高考还有 363 天</h3><p>2022 年 6 月 10 日，高考假期结束后的第三天，学校举行了高三誓师大会，同时也标志着高三生涯正式开始了。</p><h3 id="高二期末考试距离2023高考还有345天"><a class="anchor" href="#高二期末考试距离2023高考还有345天">#</a> 高二期末考试–距离 2023 高考还有 345 天</h3><p>2022 年 6 月 27~29 日</p><p>期末考试就是市统测，但是卷子出的很有问题！被不少人批判……</p><p>考试结束后 (6 月 30 号), 我们班的 6 科老师竟然要换掉 4 个！虽然原因有各种各样的 (比如刚刚来学校，带不了高三、因为某些原因离职等等)，但都跟我们班的那群 “神仙” 们脱离不了干系！(#｀-_ゝ -)</p><ul class="task-list"><li class="task-list-item"><input type="checkbox" id="cbx_0" disabled="true"><label for="cbx_0"> 数学老师走前留下的一段话 —— 从高尔顿板、正态分布到我们的未来</label></li></ul><h2 id="七月~十一月"><a class="anchor" href="#七月~十一月">#</a> 七月～十一月</h2><h3 id="暑期补习距离2023高考还有336天"><a class="anchor" href="#暑期补习距离2023高考还有336天">#</a> 暑期补习–距离 2023 高考还有 336 天</h3><ul class="task-list"><li class="task-list-item"><input type="checkbox" id="cbx_1" disabled="true"><label for="cbx_1"> 等待补充</label></li></ul><h4 id="开学距离2023高考还有280天"><a class="anchor" href="#开学距离2023高考还有280天">#</a> 开学–距离 2023 高考还有 280 天</h4><ul class="task-list"><li class="task-list-item"><input type="checkbox" id="cbx_2" disabled="true"><label for="cbx_2"> 等待补充</label></li></ul><h3 id="运动会距离高考还有251天"><a class="anchor" href="#运动会距离高考还有251天">#</a> 运动会–距离高考还有 251 天</h3><p>百日已逝，但是发现自己却是没什么作为！</p><ul class="task-list"><li class="task-list-item"><input type="checkbox" id="cbx_3" disabled="true"><label for="cbx_3"> 等待补充</label></li></ul><h2 id="十二月"><a class="anchor" href="#十二月">#</a> 十二月</h2><h3 id="疫情居家网课距离高考还有188天"><a class="anchor" href="#疫情居家网课距离高考还有188天">#</a> 疫情居家网课–距离高考还有 188 天</h3><blockquote><p>逝者如斯夫，不舍昼夜。</p></blockquote><p>没想到初三暑假降临的疫情如今卷土重来，气势汹汹！11 月 21 日被通知线上授课，本以为自己能够通过这次机遇提升一番，但事与愿违，自己还是在漫无目的的游荡，不知方向，晕头转向！🙄</p><ul class="task-list"><li class="task-list-item"><input type="checkbox" id="cbx_4" disabled="true"><label for="cbx_4"> 补充学校每日安排</label></li></ul><p>+++</p><p><s>喂，哪来 11 月 31 日的？？？</s></p><p>12.1: 明天早读英语背诵第三单元前半部分单词，有时间再写 45 套。</p><p>+++</p>]]></content:encoded>
      
      
      
